---
title: "RGBA to Hex Converter — Coding.Tools"
description: "Convert RGBA color values to hex color codes with opacity. Fast, private, and free to use."
toolTitle: "RGBA to Hex"
toolDescription: "Enter RGBA color values and convert them to a hex color code with opacity. See a live color preview and generate random colors."
category: "number-conversion"
categoryName: "Number Conversion"
